OL,3,ASaudi Arabia issues first air raid
OL,4,Aalerts for Riyadh since Houthis
OL,5,Aescalated attacks
OL,6,
OL,7,FResidents in Saudi Arabia's Riyadh have
OL,8,Fbeen given the all-clear after air raid
OL,9,Falerts were issued and explosions were
OL,10,Freported in the capital.
OL,12,FIt was the first time alerts have been
OL,13,Fissued in Riyadh since the Houthis
OL,14,Fincreased their attacks and declared a
OL,15,F"maritime embargo" on the Saudis in
OL,16,FJuly.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
