OL,3,ASaudi Arabia issues first air raid
OL,4,Aalerts for Riyadh since Houthis
OL,5,Aescalated attacks
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Saudi Civil Defence sent alerts for
OL,8,Fthe capital and several other regions
OL,9,Flate on Friday night and Saturday
OL,10,Fmorning (local time) as the Kingdom's
OL,11,Fconflict with the Iran-backed Houthis
OL,12,Fcontinued to escalate.
OL,14,FJournalists from Reuters and AFP
OL,15,Freported hearing explosions in the
OL,16,Fcapital, but authorities have since
OL,17,Fsaid the danger has passed. Residents
OL,18,Fwere urged to avoid gathering in
OL,19,Fcrowds.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/38
